{"id":"n58055-3-5","stage":5,"title":"바짝 · 猛然","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n58055-3-5-1","ko":"스웨터가 왜 이렇게 작아졌어요?","zh":"毛衣怎么变得这么小了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"스웨터가","meaning":"毛衣","explanation":"스웨터：毛衣；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"스웨터","audio":"/audio/8a2a6ac758011971cccf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65063","senseId":"1","lemma":"스웨터","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"스웨터가","audio":"/audio/6b0e946fc80925472508.mp3"}},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"이렇게","meaning":"这样","explanation":"이렇다：这样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"이렇다","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71157","senseId":"1","lemma":"이렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이렇게","audio":"/audio/9a767a1c9118d82c3af9.mp3"}},{"text":"작아졌어요?","meaning":"变小","explanation":"작아지다：变小；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"작아지다","audio":"/audio/499d0a18827621bb86ae.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71201","senseId":"1","lemma":"작아지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"작아졌어요","audio":"/audio/bfd4461075ace181ed7a.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8a2a6ac758011971","term":"스웨터","zh":"毛衣","audio":"/audio/8a2a6ac758011971cccf.mp3","entryId":"65063","definition":"用毛线织成的厚厚的上衣。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"c2f95cfd19c5a89b","term":"이렇다","zh":"这样","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3","entryId":"71157","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["이러타"]},{"id":"499d0a18827621bb","term":"작아지다","zh":"变小","audio":"/audio/499d0a18827621bb86ae.mp3","entryId":"71201","definition":"变到小的状态。","pronunciation":["자가지다"]}],"audio":"/audio/f5a8485f8b42dd9cfb8a.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n58055-3-5-2","ko":"세탁기에 넣고 빨았더니 그렇게 바짝 줄어 버렸어요.","zh":"我把它放进洗衣机洗后，就缩水得这么厉害。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"세탁기에","meaning":"洗衣机","explanation":"세탁기：洗衣机；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"세탁기","audio":"/audio/28dea2588945305d6671.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77632","senseId":"1","lemma":"세탁기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"세탁기에","audio":"/audio/738ce2426cc48dfa14f7.mp3"}},{"text":"넣고","meaning":"放进，装进","explanation":"넣다：放进，装进；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"넣다","audio":"/audio/c0bd6058bd724000a75e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64509","senseId":"1","lemma":"넣다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"넣고","audio":"/audio/bc9dd322908f47e194c3.mp3"}},{"text":"빨았더니","meaning":"洗","explanation":"빨다：洗；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；더니：根据先前观察的情况，引出后来的变化、结果或对比。","readings":[{"term":"빨다","audio":"/audio/6d3502c99e709c97953b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65866","senseId":"1","lemma":"빨다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"빨았더니","audio":"/audio/e70a0d4d9810ac4e0fb7.mp3"}},{"text":"그렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그렇게","audio":"/audio/b470a873a66143d27846.mp3"}},{"text":"바짝","meaning":"猛然，骤然","explanation":"바짝：猛然，骤然","readings":[{"term":"바짝","audio":"/audio/42892c441b42f0e17948.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58055","senseId":"3","lemma":"바짝","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"바짝","audio":"/audio/42892c441b42f0e17948.mp3"}},{"text":"줄어","meaning":"缩